# PushPress endpoint reference

Fill this in after capturing a HAR file from your gym's `members.pushpress.com` session.
This file is gitignored (the real `endpoints.md`) so credentials/cookies don't leak.

## How to capture

1. Open Chrome → DevTools → Network tab → enable "Preserve log".
2. Go to `https://members.pushpress.com` (or your gym's subdomain).
3. Log in.
4. Click around: schedule, my reservations, book a class, cancel one.
5. In Network tab → right-click any row → "Save all as HAR with content" → save in `docs/session.har`.

