## Updating the client

Open `pushpress.py`, set:
- `LOGIN_PATH`, `SCHEDULE_PATH`, `RESERVATIONS_PATH`, `BOOK_PATH`, `CANCEL_PATH`
- Rewrite `_parse_schedule` and `_parse_reservations` to match real JSON keys
- Adjust `_extract_csrf` if PushPress uses a different mechanism

Run `uv run pytest` — the existing fixtures should still pass since they mock
HTTP. Then point your `.env` at real credentials and try `uv run uvicorn main:app --port 2009`.
